{"id":"15843b2864cea929","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-substitution.md","title":"Capture-Free Raw Substitution","display":"df-substitution — Capture-Free Raw Substitution","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-substitution","aliases":["90-df-substitution"],"display":"df-substitution — Capture-Free Raw Substitution","depends_on":["[[90-df-base-free-variable]]","[[90-df-term]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-substitution — Capture-Free Raw Substitution"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b24fa26209f44674\" href=\"?note=b24fa26209f44674\" title=\"90-df-base-free-variable\">90-df-base-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"242d776aa7405493\" href=\"?note=242d776aa7405493\" title=\"90-df-term\">90-df-term</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定分层签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda\">\\(\\Lambda\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_\\Lambda\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_\\Lambda\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in C\">\\(c\\in C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in F_r\">\\(f\\in F_r\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in R_r\">\\(R\\in R_r\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\ge1\">\\(r\\ge1\\)</span>。元组内各项均属项集。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}_\\Lambda(t,x,\\varphi)\">\\(\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}_\\Lambda(t,x,\\varphi)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}^{88}_\\Lambda\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}^{88}_\\Lambda\\)</span> 按下式有限语法递归定义；后者对公式是只在可自由代入域上定义的部分运算。第 90 本的全捕获避免代入在原语法接口中另行定义，不能将二者的域混同。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E[t/x]_{88}\">\\(E[t/x]_{88}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}^{88}_\\Lambda(E,t,x)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}^{88}_\\Lambda(E,t,x)\\)</span> 的保留调用名。项位置的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,c\">\\(x,y,c\\)</span> 按叶嵌入解释。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 个子项的构造式使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec s\\in(\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda)^r\">\\(\\vec s\\in(\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda)^r\\)</span>；自由代入谓词的定义域恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda\\times\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda\\times\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_\\Lambda\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda\\times\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda\\times\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_\\Lambda\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}_\\Lambda(t,x,A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\top\\quad(A\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}^{88}_\\Lambda),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}_\\Lambda(t,x,\\neg\\varphi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}_\\Lambda(t,x,\\varphi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}_\\Lambda(t,x,\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}_\\Lambda(t,x,\\varphi)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}_\\Lambda(t,x,\\psi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}_\\Lambda(t,x,\\forall y\\varphi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\ny=x\\lor x\\notin\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(\\varphi)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor\\bigl(y\\notin\\operatorname{var}^{88}_\\Lambda(t)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}_\\Lambda(t,x,\\varphi)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathcal U_\\Lambda&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda\\cup\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_\\Lambda,\\\\\n\\mathcal D_\\Lambda&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda\\times\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda\\times\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\cup\\{(\\varphi,t,x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_\\Lambda\\times\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda\\times\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda:\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}_\\Lambda(t,x,\\varphi)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}^{88}_\\Lambda&amp;:\\mathcal D_\\Lambda\\to\\mathcal U_\\Lambda,\\qquad\nE[t/x]_{88}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Sub}^{88}_\\Lambda(E,t,x)\\quad((E,t,x)\\in\\mathcal D_\\Lambda),\\\\\ny[t/x]_{88}&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}t,&amp;y=x,\\\\y,&amp;y\\ne x,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nc[t/x]_{88}\\coloneqq c,\\\\\nf(\\vec s)[t/x]_{88}&amp;\\coloneqq f(s_0[t/x]_{88},\\ldots,s_{r-1}[t/x]_{88}),\\\\\n(s=u)[t/x]_{88}&amp;\\coloneqq(s[t/x]_{88}=u[t/x]_{88})\\quad(u\\in\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda),\\\\\nR(\\vec s)[t/x]_{88}&amp;\\coloneqq R(s_0[t/x]_{88},\\ldots,s_{r-1}[t/x]_{88}),\\\\\n(\\neg\\varphi)[t/x]_{88}&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(\\varphi[t/x]_{88})\n\\quad(\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}_\\Lambda(t,x,\\varphi)),\\\\\n(\\varphi\\land\\psi)[t/x]_{88}&amp;\\coloneqq\\varphi[t/x]_{88}\\land\\psi[t/x]_{88}\n\\quad(\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}_\\Lambda(t,x,\\varphi\\land\\psi)),\\\\\n(\\forall y\\varphi)[t/x]_{88}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall y\\varphi,&amp;y=x\\lor x\\notin\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\forall y(\\varphi[t/x]_{88}),&amp;y\\ne x\\land x\\in\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(\\varphi)\n\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{var}^{88}_\\Lambda(t)\n\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}_\\Lambda(t,x,\\varphi)\n\\end{cases}\n\\quad(\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}_\\Lambda(t,x,\\forall y\\varphi)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Sub}^{88}_\\Lambda)&amp;=\\mathcal D_\\Lambda.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}_\\Lambda(t,x,A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\top\\quad(A\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}^{88}_\\Lambda),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}_\\Lambda(t,x,\\neg\\varphi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}_\\Lambda(t,x,\\varphi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}_\\Lambda(t,x,\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}_\\Lambda(t,x,\\varphi)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}_\\Lambda(t,x,\\psi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}_\\Lambda(t,x,\\forall y\\varphi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\ny=x\\lor x\\notin\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(\\varphi)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor\\bigl(y\\notin\\operatorname{var}^{88}_\\Lambda(t)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}_\\Lambda(t,x,\\varphi)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathcal U_\\Lambda&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda\\cup\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_\\Lambda,\\\\\n\\mathcal D_\\Lambda&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda\\times\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda\\times\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\cup\\{(\\varphi,t,x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_\\Lambda\\times\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda\\times\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda:\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}_\\Lambda(t,x,\\varphi)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}^{88}_\\Lambda&amp;:\\mathcal D_\\Lambda\\to\\mathcal U_\\Lambda,\\qquad\nE[t/x]_{88}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Sub}^{88}_\\Lambda(E,t,x)\\quad((E,t,x)\\in\\mathcal D_\\Lambda),\\\\\ny[t/x]_{88}&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}t,&amp;y=x,\\\\y,&amp;y\\ne x,\\end{cases}\\qquad\nc[t/x]_{88}\\coloneqq c,\\\\\nf(\\vec s)[t/x]_{88}&amp;\\coloneqq f(s_0[t/x]_{88},\\ldots,s_{r-1}[t/x]_{88}),\\\\\n(s=u)[t/x]_{88}&amp;\\coloneqq(s[t/x]_{88}=u[t/x]_{88})\\quad(u\\in\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda),\\\\\nR(\\vec s)[t/x]_{88}&amp;\\coloneqq R(s_0[t/x]_{88},\\ldots,s_{r-1}[t/x]_{88}),\\\\\n(\\neg\\varphi)[t/x]_{88}&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(\\varphi[t/x]_{88})\n\\quad(\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}_\\Lambda(t,x,\\varphi)),\\\\\n(\\varphi\\land\\psi)[t/x]_{88}&amp;\\coloneqq\\varphi[t/x]_{88}\\land\\psi[t/x]_{88}\n\\quad(\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}_\\Lambda(t,x,\\varphi\\land\\psi)),\\\\\n(\\forall y\\varphi)[t/x]_{88}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall y\\varphi,&amp;y=x\\lor x\\notin\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\forall y(\\varphi[t/x]_{88}),&amp;y\\ne x\\land x\\in\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(\\varphi)\n\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{var}^{88}_\\Lambda(t)\n\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}_\\Lambda(t,x,\\varphi)\n\\end{cases}\n\\quad(\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}_\\Lambda(t,x,\\forall y\\varphi)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Sub}^{88}_\\Lambda)&amp;=\\mathcal D_\\Lambda.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文件依据第 90 本实际调用的接口补齐未提供的外部依赖，供本书内部使用；不声称复原未提供的外部原文。 未满足可自由代入条件时没有原始公式替换值；新鲜改名由原 90-df-syntax-interface 的 SubSpec 完整负责。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-base-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"b24fa26209f44674","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-base-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"242d776aa7405493","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-term]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Lambda","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_\\Lambda","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in C","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in F_r","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in R_r","display":false},{"tex":"r\\ge1","displ